    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈と似たような立場の、新人アイドル達だな\r\n今日は新人ユニットが何組も出るライブイベントなんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "とはいえ\r\n『W.I.N.G.』ほどじゃないから、緊張するなよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』って……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020021,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ああ！　それって、あのすごいやつのことだよね！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020021"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ちゃーんと、わかってるよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（良かった、緊張してないようで……\r\n甘奈、リラックスできているみたいだな）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "次、大崎甘奈さん、お願いしまーす！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら甘奈、出番だ\r\n元気よく行ってこい！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　プロデューサーさん、行ってくるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
