  {
    "id": 1014001020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、たっだいまー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "014",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020070",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈、お疲れ様！\r\n良かったぞ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからがすごく楽しみだ！\r\nこの調子でがんばれば『W.I.N.G.』も夢じゃない！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがと！\r\nステージ、すっごく楽しかったー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お客さんもめっちゃ応援してくれたんだー\r\nうれしかったぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、それなら良かった",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ステージが楽しめるっていうのは、\r\nアイドルとして大事なことだからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、そうなんだー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "アイドルとして大事なこと、かぁ\r\nう～ん……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ね、プロデューサーさん\r\n甘奈、どうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……どうかなって、どういうことだろう\r\nさっき褒めたけど、それじゃだめだったのか……？）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すまん、どういう意味だ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっと……甘奈、アイドルできそうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020130"
  },
  {
    "select": "甘奈なら、\r\nきっとできるよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "充分スタート地点に\r\n立てている",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "何か不安に思うことが\r\nあるのか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルックスとダンス、それに歌",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "新人アイドルとは思えないほどのものを、\r\n甘奈はちゃんと持っている",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんってば、褒めすぎだよ～\r\nえへ、でも嬉しい。ありがとっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "事実を言ったまでだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、急にどうしたんだ？\r\nステージで何かあったのか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ……？\r\nうーん……特別、何かあったってわけじゃないよー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ただ、他の子たちの頑張りを見てると\r\n本当にやっていけるのかなって心配しちゃって",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんが大丈夫って言うなら\r\n安心したかも！　うん、ありがとっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、甘奈はいいアイドルになれる\r\n自信を持っていこう！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホント？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、本当だ\r\n俺は今日のステージを見て、安心したよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈は問題なくアイドルとしてやっていけそうだし\r\n何も心配ないなって",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、そんなふうに思ってくれてたんだ\r\nでもね、甘奈は……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈には、甜花がいるじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、そっか\r\n甘奈には甜花ちゃんが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに千雪だっているしな\r\nそれでも、アイドルやっていくのは不安に思うか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……ううん、思わないかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだよね、\r\nみんなと一緒に頑張っていければ大丈夫だよね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、もちろんだ！\r\nこれから頑張っていこうな、甘奈！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきのステージ、\r\n立派にこなせていたじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "不安っていうほどじゃないんだけどねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "周りのアイドルたちのすっごいやる気を見てたら……\r\n甘奈、それについていけるのかなって",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甘奈……そんなことを思っていたのか……\r\nこれは、もっとちゃんと話を聞いた方がいいな）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈\r\nこの後、事務所に行かないか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え？　なんで？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "立ち話じゃなくて、もっとしっかり相談をしよう\r\n甘奈には、大事なことだろう？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001020270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n甘奈のこと、ちゃんと考えてくれてるんだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400102/1014001020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "当たり前じゃないか\r\n俺は甘奈のプロデューサーなんだからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
